{"ai_route":{"actual_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","ai_run_id":"airun_20261007185108_d38eaa74","expected_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","fallback_chain_id":"aifb_d6b9e19204649c916e7145e8","fallback_depth":0,"fallback_reason":"","model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","provider":"mtplx","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","route_base_url":"http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1","route_identity_hash":"c9480819205db8521fec70763515cf905334434da194fa8ae2172b40ab545075","route_profile_id":"independent_ai__mtplx_qwen38_local","thinking":"enabled"},"ai_run_id":"airun_20261007185108_d38eaa74","chunk_index":1,"job_id":"mwjob_7e176aaf6c99ace71244f370","precondition_digest":"b30dbd3ad39277a67b21f1e67f8a303ab31279e22bed1299f7a0669f40cf87e8","project_id":"proj_user_a51472163a1e","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v10","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a51472163a1e_7500033792f7287b","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a51472163a1e_7b1a85f7516cf1fe","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a51472163a1e_efa277cae6135bd0","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a51472163a1e_915b1e03edd14048"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261007185108_d38eaa74","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_a6bcb61acd0f962791fb:revision:4","quote":"多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照的II期设计；KZ-BE204每日一次口服，两组（药物+标准治疗 vs 安慰剂+标准治疗），治疗24周。","quote_sha256":"3344fb4603385a25698f8e1c2563cffd0087d3efc848ae25ce9d872bc3642628","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_a6bcb61acd0f962791fb:r4:5b6a572345e16fae","span_id":"es1"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_a6bcb61acd0f962791fb:revision:4","quote":"成人支气管扩张症（HRCT确诊），既往12个月内≥2次急性加重需抗生素治疗，稳定期≥4周。","quote_sha256":"00cf14d4c1d06220e1ab610418b018b4d48a1d3a513ce89488aa07566468f9f7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_a6bcb61acd0f962791fb:r4:5b6a572345e16fae","span_id":"es2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_a6bcb61acd0f962791fb:revision:4","quote":"主要终点：24周内需抗生素治疗的急性加重率（次/年）。","quote_sha256":"3397102abefe45e1c4b57799d030b05abe8be8cf5cdf0d1322c0f5634fcd041c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_a6bcb61acd0f962791fb:r4:5b6a572345e16fae","span_id":"es3"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_a6bcb61acd0f962791fb:revision:4","quote":"复算需每组75例；考虑20%脱落放大后每组94例，两组共188例。","quote_sha256":"6a5b8d9e0b0cbae415d3ae0ab2a7d94366d3d4a0bd72d9d89028da7313b8d76b","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_a6bcb61acd0f962791fb:r4:5b6a572345e16fae","span_id":"es4"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_a6bcb61acd0f962791fb:revision:4","quote":"研究时期：筛选期4周；双盲治疗24周；安全随访4周。","quote_sha256":"3572e66f5a0210036fd3c5e5fa2f1a86f1d1e1ae69c3ceb2f9cfb5e2784dbb75","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_a6bcb61acd0f962791fb:r4:5b6a572345e16fae","span_id":"es5"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es1","es2","es3","es4","es5"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[],"heading":"方案概要","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为多中心、随机、双盲、安慰剂平行对照的II期临床研究，旨在评价KZ-BE204（口服DPP-1抑制剂薄膜衣片）每日一次口服联合标准治疗（气道廓清加按需抗生素）对比匹配安慰剂每日一次联合相同标准治疗，在成人支气管扩张症（HRCT确诊）伴反复急性加重人群中的有效性和安全性。目标研究人群为18至80岁、HRCT确诊支气管扩张症、既往12个月内发生至少2次需抗生素治疗的急性加重、且当前处于稳定期至少4周的成人受试者；排除活动性肺结核或囊性纤维化。受试者按1:1比例随机分配至KZ-BE204组或安慰剂组，采用双模拟设计，治疗持续24周。研究时期包括筛选期4周、双盲治疗期24周和安全随访期4周。主要疗效终点为24周内需抗生素治疗的急性加重率（次/年）；关键次要终点包括首次急性加重时间、痰细菌负荷、肺功能FEV1及生活质量问卷评分；安全性终点涵盖不良事件、生命体征、实验室检查和心电图。样本量依据急性加重率组间差值0.3次/年、标准差0.6、双侧显著性水平0.05、把握度85%计算，每组需75例，考虑20%脱落率后每组纳入94例，两组共188例。主要终点采用负二项回归分析（以基线加重率为协变量），以全分析集为主分析集，安全性描述基于安全集。估计目标采用治疗政策策略，急救抗生素不改变归属，脱落不替换，按意向性治疗原则纳入全分析集。","rationale":"本段正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的总体研究设计、目标人群、干预方案、终点、样本量策略、统计分析和估计目标策略逐项写入。医学负责人需确认：（1）样本量计算参数（差值0.3、SD 0.6、α=0.05、把握度85%）是否经统计师复核并适用于PoC阶段；（2）负二项回归及FAS主分析策略是否最终确定；（3）双模拟操作细节及标准治疗（气道廓清加按需抗生素）的具体执行规范是否需在后续章节展开。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（方案概要）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、估计目标、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a51472163a1e_7500033792f7287b","section_number":"1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:282c6f81581e9cd9979be618","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_a6bcb61acd0f962791fb:r4:5b6a572345e16fae","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:e35a8dbd3c7941"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261007185108_d38eaa74","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"检索并上传支气管扩张症中国及全球流行病学数据、疾病负担文献或权威指南摘要","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_1_epidemiology","missing_source_classes":["流行病学文献","疾病负担报告","诊疗指南"],"target":"疾病背景及治疗现状章节——流行病学与疾病负担段落"},{"action":"提供当前支气管扩张症标准治疗方案综述、指南推荐及本领域未满足需求分析","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_2_1_treatment_landscape","missing_source_classes":["治疗现状综述","指南推荐摘要","未满足需求分析"],"target":"疾病背景及治疗现状章节——当前治疗现状与未满足需求段落"}],"heading":"疾病背景及治疗现状","missing_source_classes":["支气管扩张症流行病学与疾病负担文献","支气管扩张症诊疗指南（如ERS、ATS、中国专家共识）","支气管扩张症急性加重病理生理与疾病自然史综述","当前标准治疗现状与未满足需求分析"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要支气管扩张症的流行病学数据（患病率、发病率、疾病负担）、疾病自然史与急性加重病理生理描述、现行国内外诊疗指南要点以及当前标准治疗现状（包括气道廓清、长期抗生素、大环内酯类预防、吸入抗生素等）的来源支持。当前允许来源中仅有适应症名称标签，无上述任何实质内容，无法形成有信息量的正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_a51472163a1e_7b1a85f7516cf1fe","section_number":"2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:282c6f81581e9cd9979be618","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_a6bcb61acd0f962791fb:r4:5b6a572345e16fae","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_cor